{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-09_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-09","title":"再见，只为再见","storyCode":"M8-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"be93b4c7156647cfaf1b9470a9777b7774ffcc63a7f82bd65f29420b20cb54d1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拦在众人面前的，竟是扮成整合运动的乌萨斯军人。为了突破他们，盾卫选择与迷迭香联手。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"拦在指挥塔下，你是哪里的整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"是加入，还是逃跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你要与我们作战，我们也不会拦你！但是这既可耻又毫无意义！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......你见过这支小队吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。自从走出雪原，大多数整合运动的新血液，我都没兴趣认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么觉得，他们并不像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard！当心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"（暗号）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"唔咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"后撤！！是乌萨斯军人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你到死都一个字也不会说，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你心里想着我是叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"想着我们居然敢离开乌萨斯的大军，投奔卑贱的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"为了他们毫无价值的生命而战，我们既不识时务也不荣誉，所以我们的名字该从所有名册中抹去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你有丈夫或者妻子，你明明不想但还是被你的上级送到这里等死，做阴谋家的棋子，把自己的命丢给别人用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"可悲！可悲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀过乌萨斯人吗？你杀的是感染者还是市民？你手上沾血有没有觉得害怕，你晚上是不是睡不着觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"先皇死后......还留在那里的你们这些家伙......都......可悲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"别死撑着！快后退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！乌萨斯军穿上了整合运动的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，Guard！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能这么说......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么说，敌人和我们都会怀疑起自己周围的人......局势越混乱越方便他们行事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"极境的推测要是没错，那我们首先就只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阻挡住任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"可已经没多少时间了，我们不知道什么时候整合运动就会涌向指挥塔......那时候我们只会更难组织进攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们不需要所有人都加入这场战斗。对抗塔露拉，不成军队建制的小队是没有用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"后退，后退！当心破城矛的射击！找掩护！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......你又要......你可是罗德岛的领导人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢说“那我就更应该去了”......我只能说，如果一件事只有我能做，如果一件事需要被完成，那么我会去做，我会去完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"那谁来掩护你们的行动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫们，你们的伤员也动起来，把阵线稳住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还在驱赶那些特殊的感染者，牧群。狠毒。他们没有一点仁慈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我来毁掉他们的阵地和伏击点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，受乌萨斯盾卫和游击队战士支援的外人，你是第一个！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年纪尚幼的术师抬起手。战场的嘈杂声响好像与她无关，她目不斜视。她目光如炬。\n此前，她的惶恐与她的痛惜使她不断追逐着她不断流逝的记忆。\n现在，她与友人的约定，她与这些钢铁墙垛共同的责任，令她停步，令她站定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在是一支队伍。我们要停下这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不是外人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫！架盾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
